<title>SINGAPORE: Rothmans half year net profit up 36 pct.</title>
<headline>Rothmans half year net profit up 36 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  24.78  vs  18.22</p>
<p>    Group shares (cents)    21.60  vs  15.90</p>
<p>    Interim div (cents)     20.00  vs  14.80</p>
<p>    Turnover		   155.22  vs 120.34</p>
<p>    Investment income	  0.76  vs   2.88</p>
<p>    Other income		 0.07  vs   0.49</p>
<p>    Pretax			34.80  vs  25.63</p>
<p>    Tax			    9.52  vs   7.48</p>
<p>    Minorities		  (0.51) vs   0.07</p>
<p>Div pay/register - January 13 1997, December 27 1996</p>
<p>Note - Full name is Rothmans Industries Ltd.</p>
</text>
